# Intent-Oil local state. Volatile, and the ledger's hash chain cannot be merged
# across branches -- two people appending produce divergent chains. Provenance is
# local; RULES.md is the shared artifact and is committed.
ledger/
telemetry/
projections/
review_queue/
review_results/
*.lock
*.tmp

# Per-checkout settings, merged over config.yaml. The committed config has to be
# the one that works for anyone who clones; anything needing a local API key or
# a machine-specific path goes here instead.
config.local.yaml
enforcement/

# baseline.json is deliberately NOT ignored. A hidden baseline is
# indistinguishable from no rule; accepting a violation should be a line
# somebody reviews in a diff.
